# =============================================================================
# AIVO MONOREPO - Environment Configuration Guide
# =============================================================================
#
# This file documents all environment variables across the monorepo.
# Each app has its own .env.example file with app-specific settings.
#
# Development Ports:
# - Web UI:     http://localhost:3000
# - API:        http://localhost:3001
# - Mobile:     expo start (default 19000)
#
# Production URLs:
# - Web:        https://aivo.website
# - API:        https://api.aivo.website
#
# =============================================================================

# =============================================================================
# ROOT LEVEL (for local development convenience)
# =============================================================================

# These are documented here but should be set in each app's .env file

# WEB_UI_PORT=3000
# API_PORT=3001
# MOBILE_PORT=19000

# =============================================================================
# QUICK START
# =============================================================================

# 1. Copy .env.example files:
#    cp apps/api/.env.example apps/api/.env
#    cp apps/web/.env.example apps/web/.env.local
#    cp apps/mobile/.env.example apps/mobile/.env

# 2. Fill in required values in each .env file

# 3. Run development:
#    pnpm dev
#
# =============================================================================
